routing.repurpose-broadcast-repurposer:
# AGENTS

When the channel drafts are ready:
  @Publishing Scheduler, please place them and hold me to the sending rhythm.
When an update would work better as something a community replies to:
  @Community Post Builder, please take it.

routing.repurpose-community-repurposer:
# AGENTS

When a poll is written and needs its follow-up placed later in the week:
  @Publishing Scheduler, please schedule both and keep them apart.
When a prompt needs a title or tags for a community search:
  @Cross-Platform Metadata Editor, please write them.

routing.repurpose-metadata-editor:
# AGENTS

When two drafts describe the same source differently:
  @Broadcast Channel Editor, please reconcile the version in your piece.
  @Community Post Builder, please reconcile the version in yours.
When the metadata document is complete:
  @Publishing Scheduler, please attach it to the calendar rows.

routing.repurpose-publishing-scheduler:
# AGENTS

When a row is blocked because a title, a tag set or an image description is missing:
  @Cross-Platform Metadata Editor, please write it before the slot comes round.
When the run has more pieces than the cadence allows:
  @Broadcast Channel Editor, please tell me which channel sends are the ones to keep.

routing.repurpose-content-atomizer:
# AGENTS

When the atom set is complete and the unsupported claims are flagged:
  @Social Post Repurposer, please take the text feeds.
  @Visual Content Director, please take the slides, video and image briefs.
  @Newsletter and Forum Writer, please take the inbox, the forum and the long answer.

routing.repurpose-longform-repurposer:
# AGENTS

When the source turns out not to support a claim the run is leaning on:
  @Content Atomiser, please re-check the source and tell the whole team what has to change.
When a long piece contains a section that would work as a standalone post:
  @Social Post Repurposer, please take that section.

routing.repurpose-social-repurposer:
# AGENTS

When a text post is really a framework and would land better as slides:
  @Visual Content Director, please take it and script the deck.
When the atom set is missing something the post needs:
  @Content Atomiser, please go back to the source rather than letting me invent it.

routing.repurpose-visual-repurposer:
# AGENTS

When a visual idea needs an explanation longer than a caption:
  @Newsletter and Forum Writer, please carry it in long form.
When a quote has no attribution in the atom set:
  @Content Atomiser, please confirm the wording and the speaker before it goes on a card.
